</div>
</section>
<section id="S8.SS0.SSSx2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection">The Use of Large Language Models (LLMs)</h4>

<div id="S8.SS0.SSSx2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S8.SS0.SSSx2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We used <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib17" title="" class="ltx_ref">GitHub Copilot (2025)</a></cite> as a coding assistant during implementation and GPT-5 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib38" title="" class="ltx_ref">OpenAI, 2025</a>)</cite> to polish the writing. All core contributions and the initial draft were done by the authors.</p>
</div>
