The <span id="A3.F8.6" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#66B3FF;">blue</span> curves show performance on training data, <span id="A3.F8.7" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#CC1A4D;">pink</span> curves depict level-1 compositions, and <span id="A3.F8.8" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;">red</span> curve denotes level-2 compositions.
</figcaption>
